  <item>
    <title>说出三件快乐的事情原来这么难吗？｜无稽之谈Ep11</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640755e8eb39088a4a222c41</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640755e8eb39088a4a222c41</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Mar 2023 14:40:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当我问出“春天来了，大家说三件快乐的事吧”的时候，根本没想到，这个问题那么难回答！</span></p><br><p><span>之前在正向心理学里了解到一个提高幸福感的小撇步，即：每天记下三件好事。一般来说在睡觉之前花一点点时间把三件值得感恩、令自己感到快乐的事情记录下来。</span></p><br><p><span>概念了解了，但……我们的问题是，三件很难找哎！</span></p><br><p><span>张姐：“难道情绪就只能分为快乐和不快乐吗？我大多数感受到的是平静。”</span></p><p><span>77：“我可以说悲伤的三件事吗？”</span></p><br><p><span>不过尽管是这样，我们还是很开心，本集含笑量还是大概三分之一的程度。希望能感染到收音机前的朋友们！</span></p><br><p><span>另外话筒也转交给大家，可以讲讲你最近快乐的事情吗？！</span></p><br><p><span>这集的后半段我们漫无主题的聊了很多《重启人生》、死亡、殡葬、写日记、疫情记忆、如何更好的与自己相处……</span></p><br><p><span>一个愉快的周五夜晚就这样被封存在声音里了！</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/711d-audiofreehighqps/64/56/GMCoOSAH3Q8UAARMwwH_6b7p.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c8f4-audiofreehighqps/9C/C4/GMCoOSQH3Q8jAAUpXgH_6cWr.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c327-audiofreehighqps/B2/B6/GMCoOSEH3Q8xAAmeRgH_6cwu.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""></p><br><p><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>Bingo（我很好快乐的好不好）</span><br></p><br><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>高高（呼唤大家记得退税！）</span></p><p><span>77（放下话筒开始单口solo）</span></p><p><span>张姐（2023的主题：看牙）</span><br></p><br><p><br><span>本期的无稽之谈有：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a> 元气开场！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">3:02</a> 春天开了，大家一定都很开心吧？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">4:57</a> 77前段时间的治愈之旅，跟着播客旅行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">8:41</a> 凡子播客没你不行！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">9:31</a> 说快乐的三件事please</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">7:39</a> 进入寺院需要门槛吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">9:56</a> 我的快乐1:集体生日</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 我的快乐2：《克拉克森的农场》S2</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 《重启人生》的一些讨论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> 我的快乐3《村上T》村上春树</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 寺院里年轻人多吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 77:我只有悲伤的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 高高快乐1:退税退了hin多钱！恭喜！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 高高快乐2:生日礼物收到极光小夜灯！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1997">33:17</a> 高高快乐3:在电影资料馆看安哲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 张姐表示想不到自己的快乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a> 77快乐1:朋友恋爱了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a>&nbsp; 77快乐2:朋友的朋友求婚成功了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> 原来春天是抑郁症爆发的季节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 张姐因为看牙变成行动派！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">44:39</a> 张姐在养老行业工作的一些感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> 养老院像大学，很现代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2962">49:22</a> 拍摄时也见到很多失智老人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 由《好好告别》想到的死亡殡葬话题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3204">53:24</a> 葬礼跟拍微电影台湾Youtube频道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3258">54:18</a> 高高参加好朋友的葬礼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3474">57:54</a> 对死亡的禁忌让我们与逝去的家人越来越远</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3498">58:18</a> 生前预嘱协会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3775">1:02:55</a> 令我们印象深刻的一则“松弛感”家庭微博</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3967">1:06:07</a> 77终于开始聊过年的旅行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4130">1:08:50</a> 关于《假装上班的年轻人》讨论</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4386">1:13:06</a> 成长中的记忆缺失了一部分，根本想不起来！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4612">1:16:52</a> 把记忆留在日记里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4643">1:17:23</a> 疫情结束之后充满愤怒的情绪，告诉自己不能忘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4746">1:19:06</a> 紧张的情绪让自己变得有点不认识了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4766">1:19:26</a> 下班路上，小跳步的我遇到大声唱着歌骑车经过的快递小哥</span></p><br><br><p><span>提到的纪录片以及影视剧：</span></p><p><span>《重启人生》</span></p><p><span>《STUTZ》</span></p><p><span>《Ted Lasso》</span></p><p><span>《</span><span><span>永恒和一日</span></span><span>&nbsp;》</span></p><p><span>《</span><span><span>鹳鸟踟蹰</span></span><span>&nbsp;》</span></p><br><p><span>提到的书：</span></p><p><span>《村上T》</span></p><p><span>《好好告别》</span></p><br><p><span>YouTube频道：</span></p><p><span>岳澧人文映像-喪禮攝影告別式微電影</span><br></p><p><span><a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@ArtFrank" href="https://www.youtube.com/@ArtFrank">www.youtube.com</a></span><br></p><br><p><span>BGM :ES_Time for Spring - Nocturnal Spirits</span></p><p><span>封面设计：</span><b><span>77</span></b></p><br>]]></description>
