  </item>
  <item>
    <title>和在寺院工作的朋友聊聊天！｜无稽之谈Ep10</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6404b57ecbc93fcceb3600db</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6404b57ecbc93fcceb3600db</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Mar 2023 14:28:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家，好久不见，久违的更新啦，春天快乐！</span></p><br><p><span>新的一年朋友们决定多多更新声音日记，记录一些或好笑或无聊的日常观察，有空请一起来听听吧！</span></p><br><p><span>这是一期来自2022的时空胶囊录音，去年年底，在线上圣诞节交换礼物活动之前，我们和婉琳聊了聊她在寺院里的生活。</span></p><br><p><span>云雾缭绕、晚霞满天、星空下弹吉他、偶尔还可以给大家做咖啡……这真的是在寺庙嘛？</span></p><p><span>三个对寺庙充满刻板印象的人对这一切充满好奇。</span></p><p><span>“寺庙还要运营抖音？”</span></p><p><span>“你们能玩手机吗”</span></p><p><span>“你们日常会不会去逛街啊”</span></p><p><span>……</span></p><p><span>（*免责声明：以上提问都来自LMM。）</span></p><br><p><span>P.S.如果有一些问题傻到大家，先道歉为敬哈哈。</span></p><br><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ff6c-audiofreehighqps/24/86/GKwRIRwH2maWAAXH7QH_IxM1.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><br><br><p><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>Bingo（录音当下阳了刚好版）</span><br></p><br><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>LMM（寺庙知识0基础）</span></p><p><span>DDDDD（依旧是5个定）</span></p><p><span>婉琳（终于录上了！）</span><br><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/2277-audiofreehighqps/33/54/GKwRIDoH2mcxAAXuKAH_I1p7.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/e3b7-audiofreehighqps/DB/EE/GKwRIMAH2mc_AA6QHgH_I2F8.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/db25-audiofreehighqps/12/0F/GMCoOR4H2mmnAESajQH_JH6G.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><br><span>本期的无稽之谈有：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 打开时空开关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">1:42</a> 嘉宾婉琳闪现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">3:23</a> 去寺庙工作的开端</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">4:58</a> 寺院小科普NO.1</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">5:49</a> 小定和LMM眼中的寺庙（刻板印象）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">7:39</a> 进入寺院需要门槛吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 寺院工作的to do list</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 寺院里年轻人多吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 其他人为什么要去寺庙呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 建一个寺庙需要多长时间？（前疫情时代的提问）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 寺庙风格很日本，原因竟然是？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 梦想是在山上开咖啡馆～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 和同事相处起来完全没有社交压力的神仙关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 被钟声洗涤的moment</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 每年会有什么节日吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 关于去寺庙拜拜的时候是否需要说自己的身份证号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 每个人都应该学习和自己对话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 短暂离开之后再次回到寺院</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 寺院会发工资吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 在寺院感到幸福的小事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 玩手机会有限制吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> 会逛街吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 再美的美景也有审美疲劳的时候</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">37:26</a> 小定分享爷爷游历时间并为琳感到开心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 职场新人LMM对于要每天打扫院长办公室感到不服气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 寺庙建好之后，会离开吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 接待客人的师父叫“知客师”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a> 请问寺庙有没有目标做成百年老寺？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 大家对于“俗人”的一些看法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3173">52:53</a> 对于婉琳近况的更新：现在又在做摄影师啦！</span></p><br><p><span>提到的dy账号：（现在已经不是婉琳更新啦）</span></p><p><span>巧家石山寺</span></p><br><p><span>BGM :ES_Midnight Stars - Gary the Canary</span></p><p><span>封面摄影：婉琳</span></p><br><p><span>再来一些图：</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c8e1-audiofreehighqps/90/48/GKwRIaIH2mfxADCqCQH_I6tB.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/993e-audiofreehighqps/DA/2F/GKwRIW4H2mfhADe6egH_I6VA.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/bf88-audiofreehighqps/DE/1E/GKwRIRwH2mgXAATVWQH_I7rC.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/f718-audiofreehighqps/F1/A3/GKwRIUEH2mgqADPosQH_I8Nc.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/b8ea-audiofreehighqps/01/16/GMCoOSYH2mhDAAJWKgH_I83t.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4288-audiofreehighqps/BB/FF/GKwRIW4H2mhPACGA_gH_I9KJ.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/5fc7-audiofreehighqps/21/2E/GMCoOSIH2mhdAANj0AH_I9fb.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/a10a-audiofreehighqps/9E/8B/GKwRIDoH2mhxAAaaiwH_I-Gr.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3e60-audiofreehighqps/8B/E2/GKwRIaIH2mnBADtjpAH_JIlv.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/9688-audiofreehighqps/20/1C/GKwRIJEH2mnMAChblwH_JI9W.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/fb85-audiofreehighqps/3E/7D/GMCoOScH2mndABmvzQH_JJgQ.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/e01c-audiofreehighqps/87/64/GMCoOSAH2mn9AB4DSQH_JKcW.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/8b1e-audiofreehighqps/C5/13/GKwRIJEH2moHADbwkAH_JKte.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p>]]></description>
