  <item>
    <title>在婚礼半月前，和单身朋友聊聊我为什么焦虑｜无稽之谈Ep09</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6314c39f094d9b35b4ec1ed9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6314c39f094d9b35b4ec1ed9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Sep 2022 15:11:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！这期播客没有跟同事们东扯西扯，反而跟两位特别好的大学朋友一起畅聊了好久。（希望不要介意我们小喇叭一样叭叭各种八卦）</span></p><br><p><span>毕业之后几乎没有再见过面的大家如今居住在不同的城市，做着不同职业，我们一边感慨时间无情，一边也会觉得「啊真好，大家聊起天来还是跟以前完全一样哎！」</span></p><br><p><span>不过唯一跟之前的不同大概就是我们开始畅聊婚姻生活，结婚这件事，对于我来说好像还很遥远，但是对于LMH来说，即将在十几天之后成为这场仪式的女主角，而我和小DDDDD要也以伴娘的身份参与其中。</span></p><br><p><span>虽然对即将走向人生下一阶段的她满心祝福，但还是时不时脑海中冒出这两张图：</span><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/6839-audiofreehighqps/32/1F/GKwRIDoG6oI9ACVs0QGcXKNJ.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/081e-audiofreehighqps/26/C9/GKwRIaIG6oJeACYKvwGcXLw0.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><br><p><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>Bingo（你都忘了吗？！）</span><br></p><br><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>LMM（最美女主角）</span></p><p><span>DDDDD（AKA必须要5个定）</span><br><br><span>本期的无稽之谈有：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> 小D两次当伴娘经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 猜想LMM到底会哭成啥样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">4:40</a> 婚礼上伴娘也会很紧张的哈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">5:57</a> 伴娘发言环节的想象与现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">7:13</a> 距离结婚剩20多天，LMM不太想结了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">9:13</a> 备婚群惊掉下巴八卦1</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> LMM体验一把婚后生活表示：好尴尬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 和小D握手认同婚姻生活里最好不要妄想改变彼此</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> LMM对此表示：你们too young too simple</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 婕彤，你的预言灵验了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> 关于LMM的相亲经历，小D也记得太多细节了叭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 啊求婚这件事每个女生是不是都有想过？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 原来求婚这个环节好像也不是每个女生都觉得很必要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 求婚视频让我泪洒北漂屋的up主是kat and sid 555</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 对于当众求婚这件事，我们都觉得emmmmmmm</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 结婚好麻烦！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1839">30:39</a> 当进入婚礼行业，打破了小D对婚礼的滤镜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> 婚礼准备的各个环节里，男生为何普遍缺位？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 婚礼上如果有惊喜环节岂不是很特别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">43:31</a> 哇 婚礼要花这么多钱？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">50:47</a> 择偶观大调查</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3181">53:01</a> 备婚群惊掉下巴八卦2</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3391">56:31</a> 备婚群惊掉下巴八卦3</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3902">1:05:02</a> 传统观念里为何女性总是“局外人”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4465">1:14:25</a> 单身LMM给婚后LMM的留言！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4514">1:15:14</a> 小D给LMM的祝福</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4584">1:16:24</a> 小小小小彩蛋</span></p><br><p><span>提到的绿色丑鞋：</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/3e93-audiofreehighqps/71/29/GMCoOSYG6oKjAAFSCgGcXOeX.jpeg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><br><p><span>BGM :ES_Pockets Filled With Love - Gerard Franklin</span></p><p><span>封面插图：</span><b><span>Irene Rinaldi</span></b></p><br><p><span>您可以在小宇宙App、苹果播客Podcast、Spotify、喜马拉雅找到我们，下期再会～</span></p>]]></description>
